<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84612" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολῠάνθ-εμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθεμον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rich in flowers,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρουραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					25.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίτραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anacr.
					65.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὧραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					13.17
				</span></i>
			: in later Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.294f
				</span></i>
			. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ής, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθέω</span>) <i>blooming,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.353
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Hom.</u>
					19.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτερύγων χροιή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					2.59
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.320
			</span></i>, al.: in later Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύμβρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					15.4.4
				</span></i>
			; <i>parti-coloured,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρωμναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					31.8
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				5.30
			</span></i>: poet. fem. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυάνθεα, γλήχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					877
				</span></i>
			.</div>
